        { "text", text = "Hex of Weakness: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Var'jun|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10 in Mulgore, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Var'jun|r, just south-west of Bloodhoof Village, hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r in Orgrimmar." },
