        { "text", text = "At 20, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Aelthalyste|r in the |cOXP_PICK_War Quarter|r teaches Dark Sacrifice with a quest she gives and takes back at once (its text still speaks of Devouring Plague, which every priest now learns from the trainer)." },
