      { only = "Scourge Rogue",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mennet Carkad|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Varimathras|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mennet Carkad|r sends the ledger on to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Varimathras|r, the big demon in the middle of the Hall of the Dark Lady in the |cOXP_PICK_Royal Quarter|r, past its elite guards; the way in is the passage off the Apothecarium. If you lose the ledger, take another from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Andron Gant|r's bookshelf." },
