        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Shadow Priest Sarvis|r gives you a |cOXP_LOOT_Consecrated Scroll|r after The Mindless Ones: read it, then bring it to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Aramis Hammerhand|r by the church. He asks you to heal five |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Injured Deathguard|r lying around Deathknell. Holy Light hurts a Forsaken paladin a little each time: watch your health." },
