        { "text", text = "The crypt under Shadowvale" },
        { "text", text = "The cellar is under the village, not on the surface: the way down is inside a burned-out house, where the arrow points. Twelve Lumber Piles (stacked beams) lie in the cellar, each good for one |cOXP_LOOT_Sturdy Lumber|r. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Whispering Horror|r, an elite (level 11-13), sits at the far end: leave it alone." },
        { "goto", x = 12.9, y = 65.7, zone = "1420" },
