        { "text", text = "Hex of Weakness: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10, go to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r, the priest trainer in a hut in the |cOXP_PICK_Valley of Spirits|r, Orgrimmar's south-west corner: he gives Hex of Weakness and takes it back at once. No letter needed." },
