        { "text", text = "At 10, go to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Aelthalyste|r, the priest trainer in the Undercity's |cOXP_PICK_War Quarter|r: she gives Touch of Weakness and takes it back at once. No letter needed. From Brill, follow the road south to the ruined city of Lordaeron; the Undercity's lifts are at the back of the throne room. Touch of Weakness strikes the next melee attacker for Shadow damage and lowers its melee attack power for 2 minutes." },
