        { "text", text = "Spirit Rock sits on a ledge in the hills just south of the Den. The Hidden Path up starts at the foot of the hills south-west of the Den, between two idle peons; it climbs south-west into the hills, then bends back east to the rock. Stand right beside the stone and drink the |cOXP_LOOT_Earth Sapta|r: the |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Minor Manifestation of Earth|r appears for a short while, so speak to it at once (walk almost under it if it does not answer). Coming back, you can drop down the ledge towards the Den instead of walking the path." },
        { "goto", x = 44.1, y = 76.4, zone = "1411" },
        { "item", item = 6635, text = "Use Earth Sapta (|cOXP_LOOT_Earth Sapta|r, beside Spirit Rock)" },
