      { only = "Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "Child of Nature" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Alfina Nightgaze|r stands beside |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Denaaris Stargale|r and the Skyborne Portal, west of Dalaran, where the skycutter from Zephras Isle lands. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver|r offers the same quest." },
