        { "text", text = "Touring the Grounds" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Breton Samuels|r gives you a weapon, then sends you round the keep to speak with four of its people: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Hilda the Breaker|r just south of the gate, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ander Solliden|r, the lookout, who walks the road south-east of the keep, then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jorin Croge|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Danitha Morr|r inside the keep. Pick the conversation option with each." },
