        { "accept", quest = 5922, text = "Accept Moonglade" },
        { "target", name = "Turak Runetotem" },
      },
      { only = "Tauren Druid",
        { "text", text = "Moonglade" },
        { "text", text = "Cast Teleport: Moonglade: it lands you beside the building where |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r stands upstairs. The Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Speak to it and go through all of its words (what it represents, the strength of the body, the strength of the heart, then ask for its blessing): the talk is the objective, there is no fight. It blends into the ground, has no quest mark and gives off a faint blue-grey glow by a group of three trees: from Nighthaven go west along the foot of the northern mountains, through the gap between the trees and the hills. If |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r is missing when you return, step outside and cast Teleport: Moonglade again. Learn the Moonglade flight path (Faustron, south-west of the lake); |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bunthen Plainswind|r in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff." },
        { "goto", x = 56.21, y = 30.64, zone = "1450" },
