        { "text", text = "Hand the letter to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Valley of Spirits|r, Orgrimmar (from Mulgore: north through the Barrens and east into Durotar, or fly from Thunder Bluff once you know Orgrimmar's flight path)." },
