        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sheldras Moontree|r" },
        { "text", text = "The Skyborne Portal takes you to Stormwind. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sheldras Moontree|r is the city's druid trainer (the arrow points at him); he teaches you Teleport: Moonglade with the next quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)." },
