      { only = "Orc Warrior/Orc Shaman/Troll Warrior/Troll Shaman",
        { "text", text = "Razormane camp" },
        { "text", text = "The Razormane camp lies east of the Crossroads. Warriors: the |cOXP_PICK_Stolen Iron Chest|r stands in the camp. Shamans: the quilboar drop the |cOXP_LOOT_Fire Tar|r.\nCareful: The chest stands next to a broken wagon, guarded by a pair of Razormanes, including hunters that can pull more quilboar into the fight." },
