      {
        { "text", text = "Dry Hills" },
        { "text", text = "West to the Dry Hills. The Witchwing harpies nest all over them; any of them can drop a talon. Chen's Empty Keg lies in their hills. Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Regthar Deathgate|r and the hills: take their claws on the way.\nCareful: There are 2 Witchwing Ambushers (level 17-18). They stay stealthed with Sneak while out of combat." },
