      {
        { "text", text = "Samophlange" },
        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_PICK_Control Console|r stands at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the |cOXP_LOOT_Console Key|r from |cOXP_ENEMY_Tinkerer Sniggles|r beside it.\nCareful: Several guards stand within aggro range of the valves, respawn in under about 3 minutes, and run at low health to bring back help; nearby mobs also join if you use a valve while they are close." },
        { "goto", x = 52.4, y = 11.65, zone = "1413" },
