        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Telf Joolam|r makes |cOXP_LOOT_Fire Sapta|r from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the |cOXP_ENEMY_Minor Manifestation of Fire|r, kill it for the |cOXP_LOOT_Glowing Ember|r, then place the ember in the brazier." },
