        { "accept", quest = 1961, text = "Accept Gathering Materials" },
        { "target", name = "Anastasia Hartwell" },
      },
      { only = "Mage",
        { "text", text = "Ambermill" },
        { "text", text = "Leave the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine Forest. Every Dalaran human drops a |cOXP_LOOT_Dalaran Mana Gem|r four times in five, and |cOXP_LOOT_Linen Cloth|r too: the easiest are the Dalaran Apprentices (level 13-14, Frostbolt) on the hills south-east of the Sepulcher, either side of the road south; deeper in, the walled town of Ambermill in south-east Silverpine has Watchers (18-19, Fire Shield and Flamestrike) and Wizards (19-20, Frost Nova) that come back every 4 1/2 minutes and run for help at low health, so pull at the edge. Ten |cOXP_LOOT_Linen Cloth|r also come from any humanoid or the Undercity Auction House." },
        { "goto", x = 52.25, y = 64.46, zone = "1421" },
        { "complete", obj = 2, quest = 1961, text = "Dalaran Mana Gem: 6" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Apprentice" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Watcher" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Wizard" },
        { "goto", x = 51.58, y = 64.26, zone = "1421" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 1961, text = "Linen Cloth: 10" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Apprentice" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Miner" },
        { "mob", name = "Dalaran Brewmaster" },
      },
      { only = "Mage",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Josef Gregorian|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to the Undercity. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Josef Gregorian|r, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Victor Ward|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Rhiannon Davis|r keep the tailor's shop in the |cOXP_PICK_Magic Quarter|r. Hand the gems and cloth to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Josef Gregorian|r and let the three of them talk for a moment; then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Josef Gregorian|r offers Spellfire Robes: take it and hand it straight back to him for the robe." },
        { "goto", x = 70.76, y = 30.69, zone = "1458" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1961, text = "Turn in Gathering Materials" },
        { "target", name = "Josef Gregorian" },
        { "goto", x = 70.76, y = 30.69, zone = "1458" },
        { "accept", quest = 1962, text = "Accept Spellfire Robes" },
        { "target", name = "Josef Gregorian" },
        { "goto", x = 70.76, y = 30.69, zone = "1458" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1962, text = "Turn in Spellfire Robes (|cOXP_LOOT_Lesser Spellfire Robes|r)" },
        { "target", name = "Josef Gregorian" },
      },
      {
        { "text", text = "The Crossroads" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sergra Darkthorn|r by the inn first, then the innkeeper, Helbrim by the north gate, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Thork|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Darsok Swiftdagger|r on the tower platform, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mankrik|r by the inn, and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tonga Runetotem|r at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the |cOXP_ENEMY_Verog the Dervish|r pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills. After the spores Helbrim offers Apothecary Zamah, a delivery to Thunder Bluff within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to Thunder Bluff)." },
        { "goto", x = 52.23, y = 31.01, zone = "1413" },
        { "turnin", quest = 903, text = "Turn in Prowlers of the Barrens" },
