      { only = "NightElf Druid/Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "Trial of the Lake" },
        { "text", text = "Cast Teleport: Moonglade to get here: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r stands upstairs in the building beside where you land. Trial of the Lake runs on a 30-minute timer: once you accept it, no teleport or Hearthstone until |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r has it. Six Bauble Containers (vases) lie in narrow hollows deep on the floor of Lake Elune'ara below Nighthaven, often near the bubbling fissures (the |cOXP_PICK_Bubbly Fissure|r in the middle of the lake refills your breath); each comes back three minutes after it is opened, and other druids take them too. Check the |cOXP_LOOT_Shrine Bauble|r is in your bags before you surface: it fades five minutes after you loot it. Swim it straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it inside the shrine grounds and speak to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r by the tree." },
