      {
        { "text", text = "Trouble in the Valley" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Corporal Adamore|r and his marines hold the wrecked caravan south of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Walton|r. The marines are linked: pulling one calls the rest. Pull from the edge and run; they leash short, so you can thin the camp one at a time before tackling the Corporal." },
        { "goto", x = 41.8, y = 15.6, zone = "1413" },
