        { "text", text = "On the way back down the Gold Road to Camp Taurajo: the Razormane Raiders among the Bristleback camps, either side of the road north of the camp, carry |cOXP_LOOT_Olgra's Adornments|r. Hand them to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mankrik|r on your last Crossroads stop." },
        { "goto", x = 49.81, y = 45.81, zone = "1413" },
