        { "text", text = "The antennae vanish fifteen minutes after they drop: kill the Silithid Swarmers and Creepers at the Field of Giants' mounds, just south of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jorn Skyseer|r's thunderhawks, until you have five, then take them straight to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ruga Ragetotem|r in Camp Taurajo.\nCareful: Silithid Swarmers (level 21-22) cast |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silithid Swarm|r both in and out of combat, which brings several small adds. Silithid Creepers (level 20-21) periodically cast |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silithid Creeper Egg|r in combat, which spawns extra adds." },
